---
import Layout from '../lc/layouts/Layout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'June 4, 2025';
const sections = [
  { id: 'overview',       title: '1. Overview' },
  { id: 'digital',        title: '2. Digital Product Refunds' },
  { id: 'eligibility',    title: '3. Eligibility for Refund or Store Credit' },
  { id: 'resolution',     title: '4. Resolution Process & Timeline' },
  { id: 'processing',     title: '5. Refund Processing' },
  { id: 'chargebacks',    title: '6. Chargebacks & Disputes' },
  { id: 'contact',        title: '7. Contact Us' },
];
---

<Layout title="Cancellation & Refund Policy | Global Formulation" description="Understand Global Formulation's cancellation and refund policy for digital products and consulting services — eligibility, timelines, and how to request a refund.">

  <!-- ── Page Header ── -->
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="legal-hero-inner">
      <span class="legal-eyebrow">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Effective date: <strong>{lastUpdated}</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; Global Formulation</p>
      <p class="legal-summary">
        Customer satisfaction is our top priority. Please read the following terms carefully before making a purchase.
        If you have any questions, contact us before buying — we are happy to help.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Document Body ── -->
  <div class="legal-body">

    <!-- Sidebar ToC -->
    <aside class="legal-toc">
      <p class="toc-head">Contents</p>
      <nav>
        <ol class="toc-list">
          {sections.map(s => (
            <li><a href={`#${s.id}`}>{s.title}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <!-- Main document -->
    <article class="legal-doc">

      <section id="overview">
        <h2>1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          Global Formulation sells technical e-books and digital reference guides through our online store.
          Because our products are delivered digitally and are immediately accessible upon purchase, our refund
          policy is necessarily limited — but we are committed to resolving genuine issues fairly and promptly.
        </p>
        <p>
          This policy applies to all purchases made through <strong>globalaerosols.com/store</strong>.
          By completing a purchase, you acknowledge that you have read and agreed to these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="digital">
        <h2>2. Digital Product Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          Due to the nature of digital content, we do not offer refunds once a product has been delivered or
          downloaded. Digital files, once accessed, cannot be "returned" in the same way as physical goods.
        </p>
        <p>
          We make an exception — and will consider a refund or store credit — in the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Corrupted or unreadable file</strong> — the PDF file you received cannot be opened or is otherwise technically defective.</li>
          <li><strong>Material misdescription</strong> — the content of the product materially differs from what is described on the product page (e.g. a different subject, missing chapters, or significantly fewer pages than stated).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Dissatisfaction with the depth of content, a change of mind, or purchasing the wrong product do not
          qualify for a refund. We encourage you to read the product description, table of contents, and any
          free sample excerpt available before purchasing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="eligibility">
        <h2>3. Eligibility for Refund or Store Credit</h2>
        <p>
          Where your issue qualifies under Section 2, you may choose one of the following resolutions:
        </p>
        <table class="legal-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Resolution Option</th><th>What It Means</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Full Refund</td>
              <td>The full purchase amount is returned to your original payment method. Refunds are processed within 2–3 working days of approval (see Section 5).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Store Credit</td>
              <td>An equivalent credit is applied to your account and can be used toward any other e-book in our store. Credits do not expire.</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>
          To be eligible, you must report the issue to us within <strong>7 days of purchase</strong>.
          Reports received after this window will not be considered unless exceptional circumstances apply.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="resolution">
        <h2>4. Resolution Process &amp; Timeline</h2>
        <p>To raise a refund or store credit request, email us at
          <a href="mailto:consulting@globalaerosols.com">consulting@globalaerosols.com</a> with:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your full name and the email address used at checkout.</li>
          <li>The title of the e-book purchased.</li>
          <li>A clear description of the issue (and, where applicable, a screenshot or error message).</li>
          <li>Your preferred resolution — refund or store credit.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Once we receive your request:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>We will <strong>acknowledge your request within 2 business days</strong>.</li>
          <li>We aim to <strong>fully resolve the matter within 5 business days</strong> of acknowledgement.</li>
          <li>If we need additional information from you, the resolution timeline will restart from the date we receive your response.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="processing">
        <h2>5. Refund Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Approved refunds will be credited back to the original payment method used at the time of purchase.
          Please allow <strong>2–3 working days</strong> from the date of approval for the refund to appear
          in your account. Processing times may vary depending on your bank or card issuer and are beyond
          our control once the refund has been initiated on our end.
        </p>
        <p>
          Store credit is applied immediately upon approval and will be visible in your account within
          1 business day.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="chargebacks">
        <h2>6. Chargebacks &amp; Disputes</h2>
        <p>
          We strongly encourage you to contact us directly at
          <a href="mailto:consulting@globalaerosols.com">consulting@globalaerosols.com</a> before
          initiating a chargeback or payment dispute with your bank or card issuer. We are committed to
          resolving genuine issues quickly and fairly — most cases are resolved within 5 business days.
        </p>
        <p>
          Initiating a chargeback without first attempting resolution through our support process may be
          treated as a breach of these terms. In such cases, we reserve the right to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Suspend or permanently close the associated account.</li>
          <li>Revoke access to any purchased digital content.</li>
          <li>Provide relevant transaction records to the payment processor to contest the chargeback.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We take fraudulent chargebacks seriously and will pursue all available remedies where a
          chargeback is found to be unsubstantiated.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="contact">
        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For all refund, cancellation, or product-related queries, please contact us via the details below.
          We aim to respond to every request promptly and resolve it fairly.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-contact-block">
          <p><strong>Global Formulation</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:consulting@globalaerosols.com">consulting@globalaerosols.com</a></p>
          <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919819548320">+91 98195 48320</a></p>
          <p>Website: <a href="https://globalaerosols.com">globalaerosols.com</a></p>
        </div>
        <p>
          Please include your order details in any correspondence to help us resolve your query as quickly as possible.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="legal-footer-note">
        <p>This policy was last reviewed and updated on <strong>{lastUpdated}</strong>. © {new Date().getFullYear()} Global Formulation. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>

    </article>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ── */
  .legal-hero {
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 30%, rgba(9, 104, 229,0.13) 0%, transparent 60%), #060a14;
    padding: 130px max(6%, env(safe-area-inset-left)) 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .legal-hero-inner { max-width: 800px; }
  .legal-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #4f9dff;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .legal-meta { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #64748b; margin: 0 0 20px 0; }
  .legal-meta strong { color: #94a3b8; }
  .legal-summary {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Layout: sidebar + document ── */
  .legal-body {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px max(4%, 24px) 100px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  /* ── Sticky ToC Sidebar ── */
  .legal-toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
  }
  .toc-head {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #0968e5;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }
  .toc-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0; margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .toc-list li a {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: #475569;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .toc-list li a:hover { background: #e0effe; color: #0968e5; }

  /* ── Document content ── */
  .legal-doc section {
    margin-bottom: 52px;
    padding-bottom: 52px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }
  .legal-doc section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .legal-doc h2 {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0 0 18px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    scroll-margin-top: 90px;
  }
  .legal-doc h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 28px 0 10px 0;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  }
  .legal-doc p {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
  }
  .legal-doc p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-doc ul {
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 14px 0 14px 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .legal-doc ul li {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.65;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .legal-doc ul li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #0968e5;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .legal-doc a { color: #0968e5; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .legal-doc a:hover { color: #3b82f6; }
  .legal-doc strong { color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600; }

  .legal-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin: 18px 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .legal-table th {
    background: #f1f5f9;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .legal-table td {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    color: #475569;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
    line-height: 1.55;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .legal-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .legal-table tr:hover td { background: #f8fafc; }
  .legal-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; white-space: nowrap; }

  .legal-contact-block {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-left: 3px solid #0968e5;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .legal-contact-block p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .legal-footer-note {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }
  .legal-footer-note p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .legal-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      padding: 40px 24px 80px;
    }
    .legal-toc { position: static; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-hero { padding: 110px 22px 50px; }
    .legal-body { padding: 30px 20px 60px; }
    .legal-table { font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .legal-table td:first-child { white-space: normal; }
  }
</style>
